#story An old record is opened
#step actor A reviewer
#step action opens a record written before this change
#step subject its guide
#file src/main/lantern-guide-parse.ts
#file skills/lantern-setup/scripts/prguide.mjs
#below consequence the pseudocode lines were read and checked => they are skipped and the guide reads the same
#guide The guide no longer has pseudocode anywhere, and old records that still have it keep working.
#risk low Only removes a feature; the one new rule is that both parsers skip an old pseudocode line.
#gstep careful Old pseudocode lines are ignored
#gwhy Both parsers now skip a legacy pseudocode line before any check, so committed records stay valid and read the same. The types and limits that only served pseudocode go.
